<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<component type="desktop-application">
    <id>com.steep.Steep</id>
    <name>Steep</name>
    <summary>A modern, AI-enhanced RAW photo editor</summary>
    <summary xml:lang="cs">Program pro konverzi a zpracování digitálních raw fotografií</summary>
    <summary xml:lang="fr">Logiciel de conversion et de traitement de photos numériques de format raw (but de capteur)</summary>
    <summary xml:lang="pl">Zaawansowany program do wywoływania zdjęć typu raw</summary>
    <translation type="gettext">rawtherapee</translation>
    <description>
        <p>Steep is a modern, AI-enhanced fork of RawTherapee for professional RAW photo editing. It adds a modernized interface with mode-based editing, AI-powered tools (semantic masking, denoising, inpainting), professional color grading, and an MCP server for AI agent integration — all while preserving every original RawTherapee feature.</p>
        <p>Steep is designed for developing raw files from a broad range of digital cameras, as well as HDR DNG files and non-raw image formats (JPEG, TIFF and PNG). The target audience ranges from enthusiast newcomers to professional photographers looking for AI-assisted workflows and a modern editing experience.</p>
    </description>
